WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.290
99th
Hokuou
Academy
Joint Campus Festival

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:05.370
Come get your delicious okonomiyaki!

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.040
Oops, excuse m-

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:14.370
A-Akuma is walking with a girl?!

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:16.200
She's wearing our junior high section's uniform!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.660
Is this a kidnapping?!

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.950
Everyone's staring daggers at me!

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:22.910
Forgive me...

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.450
At times like this... I should smile...

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.200
Didn't mean to scare you to DEATH...

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:36.870
Shake
Worry

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.450
Death?! H-h-help!

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.830
DEATH? N-no! I said I scared you to death!

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.830
D-d-d-don't kill me!

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:36.870
Big Brother.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.040
What are you even doing?

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.500
I wish you'd escort me properly.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.830
O-okay.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.660
It's more crowded than I imagined!

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:48.000
Val love "Campus Festival Date"...

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.620
Seems like it's a bonus stage

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:53.040
where the more we go around together
the more experience points we acquire,

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.700
but I have to make sure I do my best
not to die from fear!

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.080
Big Brother.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
I wish you'd hurry up.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.620
Maid Café
C'mon in

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.000
You two sure took your time!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.000
But what's wrong?
You look like you're about to die.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:11.120
N-nothing. It's very crowded.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:12.620
I'm hungry...

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:15.160
I'll take you to a table, so hold on a second.

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:17.120
Please take your time and enjoy!

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.620
Th-thanks.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:20.790
What is it?

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:23.370
I-It's nyaathing!

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:27.040
Something weird's going on with Natsuki-san.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.410
Did I do something wrong again?

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.000
But right now...

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:32.830
What?

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.830
Er, nothing!

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:38.120
Uh, Yakumo-san, what would you like to eat?

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:41.200
Anything is fine,
so I wish you'd hurry up and choose.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.000
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:47.250
I'm getting agitated for some reason.

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.080
Okay, this is where I...

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:53.540
Rumble
Rumble

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:53.540
Let's see... well then, we'll have this
squid ink pasta with squid ink on the side...

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:55.580
Sorry for the wait!

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:57.790
Here's the Lovey-Dovey Couple drink!

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:59.080
Um... err...

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:03.000
It's alright, this is my treat. After all, I'm...

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.410
Yakumo's big sister, you know!

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:08.000
Take that!

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:07.700
O-okay, I appreciate your kindness.

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:09.290
Ew.

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:09.910
Huh?

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:13.370
I don't wanna drink from the same cup as you.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:14.540
That's gross.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:15.370
But...

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:18.870
If you insist, though...

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:22.370
Then suck on this.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:25.500
May as well since we'll be
drinking it together, right?

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.040
Uh, but...

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.870
I wish you'd get on with it.

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.120
R-right! Sorry.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.790
You're so bad at this... easy with the teeth.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:45.500
S-s-sorry.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.580
Sue is so much better at this.

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:53.290
That feels nice.

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:55.120
Do you want to drink more?

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.500
U-uh, yes, please.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.540
My neck is getting stiff.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:02.040
I'll adjust my posture...

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.750
Woah, I'm soaked. Gross.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.200
S-s-s-sorry!

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:13.620
Were you hoping to suck on something like this too?

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.160
Pervert.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.120
Pervert

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.080
Stab!

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.540
Yakumo! You can't take your clothes off here!

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:21.080
Natsuki, get off my back.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.540
Shock! A-anyways, put your clothes on!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.500
Ooh, there's a huge crowd here.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.540
But what are you guys doing?

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.950
Misa, sisters, hey there!

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.580
Getting here was pretty rough.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.250
Pretty rough!

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:38.080
Everyone seems to be fully
enjoying themselves despite that.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:44.750
Chatter
Chatter
Chatter

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.040
Hey, what the hell is going on there?

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:42.450
Akuma is surrounded by girls?!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.120
This absolutely has to be...

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.620
Blackmail!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.410
My stomach hurts!

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:52.120
By the way, Takuma-chan.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:55.370
Are you okay with being Natsuki-chan's
partner for the dance party?

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.620
Y-you mean that thing?

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:00.080
What are you talking about?

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:03.040
I heard there's a late-night festival where
a man and a woman pair up and dance.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.410
Is there a huge event like that?!

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.910
D-dance party, huh?

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:11.370
But I have no interest whatsoever
in cute things like that!

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:15.620
And I've never thought anything like
I'd like to try dancing with Takuma at least once...

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:16.870
You're so obvious!

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:19.620
I think Natsuki would make a good partner.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:22.000
I sincerely do not care.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:23.790
R-really?

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:26.580
But I want to dance too!

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:28.540
Which do you like more, dancing or snacks?

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:29.830
Snacks!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:35.330
W-well, I don't care either way,
but if that's what everyone wants...

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.080
Er, well, you see....

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.790
It's just that I don't want to go with Natsuki,

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:44.830
but lately people have been getting scarier to me
day by day or something like that,

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:50.330
and it feels even more like I'm gonna get killed
if I'm with such a popular girl like Natsuki-san.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:54.370
So maybe it'd be better
if I paired up with someone else...

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:56.910
Er, um...

00:04:57.160 --> 00:05:00.410
I forgot that I'm working right now.

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:02.540
Big Sisters, see you later!

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:07.040
Takumacchi, pretend that
fairly awful exchange didn't happen.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.120
Huh?!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.870
Yes, that was fairly awful.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:14.790
Nanna.
A sprite that lives in the realm of the gods.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:14.790
Munch

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.750
A fairy?

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.790
Nanna the Fairy always
gives me snacks so I love Nanna!

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.950
Dance Party Info

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.290
I just don't want to go with Natsuki-san.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.290
I get that he has no interest in me, but...

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.540
Natsuki-chan, are you okay?

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:29.120
I thought you might be feeling down.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.000
N-No, I'm not.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.950
Still so young...

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:37.250
M-more importantly, Big Sister Futaba,
are you all doing okay?

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.950
I'm shocked everyone came today, too.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:42.950
Goodness, what a day this has turned into...

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:42.950
Hokuou Academy's No. 1 will be decided!
Miss Hokuou Academy Beauty Pageant
Beauty Pageant

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:44.370
What is this?!

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:46.200
I'm looking forward to seeing who wins.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.080
I didn't enter this!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.580
Someone else chose to do that!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.660
Itsuyo-chan applied to this!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.080
She said it was a competition.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.700
That idiot!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.450
But there's something else I really want to hear about!

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:58.830
I already know.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:02.080
Big Sister Ichika is on alert for us.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.080
The captain is?!

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:08.200
The campus festival is a chance for
all of us to raise our levels at once.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.950
But the buildings are now densely packed.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:13.120
Therefore, the crowd is overflowing.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:17.750
Under these circumstances,
the enemy is definitely setting something up.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:26.750
Haunted House

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.750
Three guests, coming through.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.750
A-Akuma?! Someone come work the front for me!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.500
This is pretty professional.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.200
Uh, Takuma?!

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:44.950
tremble
shiver
shiver
tremble

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:38.660
I don't mind ghosts, but when I think about
people dressing up I-I-I-I...

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.410
Your phobia of people!

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:41.700
And what's wrong with you, Kururi?!

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.330
I thought it was a snack house!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.950
That's not even close!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.330
Misa-san...

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.660
Big Sis Misa...

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:50.450
You two are hopeless. Jeez.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.580
Watch your step, okay?

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.040
Sorry, Big Sister Misa.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.000
I-I-I'm truly sorry about this...

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:03.750
You know, Takuma, a guy
really shouldn't cower that much.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.790
It lowers your self-worth.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:07.540
Huh? Oh well... Er...

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:08.950
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.000
You said it again.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.330
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.660
Listen to me.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:16.330
When you're feeling helpless,
don't say "sorry," say "Thanks."

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.950
That sounds way cooler.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.750
Misa-san...

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.750
Messy

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.160
Maybe it's because her hair is nice and neat,

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.750
What's up?

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.580
but she seems less aggressive than usual.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:27.870
Thank you, Big Sister Misa.

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:29.660
You're welcome.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.250
Th-that stupid Akuma!

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:37.120
While I'm covered in sweat from working
he's freakin' flirting with girls!

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:40.500
Maybe it's time to settle old scores, huh?!

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:43.870
Also, apologize to Natsuki later, okay?

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:45.950
All of that made her pretty angry.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:49.660
Er, why was Natsuki-san angry?

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.750
You should at least figure that part out on your own...

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.580
R-right, er... Sorry.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:58.790
Or maybe I should say "thanks"?

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.000
You're very rigid, aren't you?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.200
That's another reason Natsuki is angry with you!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.910
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.330
Kururi?! What's wrong with her?

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.410
Who knows.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:16.370
Of course you'd be afraid of a live eel.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:18.250
Now for the other two.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:26.910
Wh-what happened?!

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:29.160
There's something in my clothes!

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:30.330
T-Takuma...

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.160
Yes?

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:35.040
I can't stand... the wriggling...

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.330
Get it out...

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.580
O-okay. Here goes...

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.580
N-no, go lower!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:51.200
I-I'm sorry, I mean, thank you very much!

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.040
You idiot!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:04.000
No... don't touch me there!

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:11.750
I'll let it go outside!

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.000
Hey, someone might be falling out of the window!

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.910
I-idiot... Now he's alone...

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.540
Is he falling or not?

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:19.160
He fell!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.910
I-I'm exhausted.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:27.330
What am I doing?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:32.120
I was planning to focus on my studies
during the campus festival...

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.950
Seriously, why in the world is this happening?

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:36.160
Academic
Achievement

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:36.160
Akutsu-senpai?

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:39.830
Uh, y-you're from the student council...

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:43.200
I'm Inukai. What are you doing here?

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:47.910
Huh?! W-Well to be honest,
I thought this eel here was a ghost,

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:51.700
and uh, I went out to look for some water I guess, um...

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:54.540
You're very entertaining.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:10:01.290
Thumptwitch
Thumptwitch

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:58.120
He's the first person I've talked to
besides Natsuki-san and her sisters,

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:01.290
but I'm doing fairly well... kind of...

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:06.750
But I'm shocked to see that you're
actually enjoying the festival, Senpai.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:10.330
Actually... I, uh... was invited by someone I know.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:13.000
O-oh, is that so?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:17.250
Then I suppose I have to show some appreciation
to that person you know, right?

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.370
Where did Takuma-san go?

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:21.910
He might be over here.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:24.080
What, are you feeling discouraged, Natsuki?!

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:26.080
Huh? I-I'm really not...

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:30.540
I do think that it'll be fine since
Big Sister Ichika is here, but...

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:35.040
Excuse us, we're in a hurry. Let us pass through here.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.200
I've been worried about you this whole time.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.830
I had no idea what I'd do if you hadn't shown up.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.500
I thought I would starve to death...

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:57.830
An akuma!

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:06.620
Those akuma are the kind that possess humans!

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.580
Did they really possess the entire academy?!

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:16.620
Someone once said that love is
the source of a maiden's power.

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:20.040
That's why I must stop that source.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:27.200
Battling maidens without their Einheijer
are the same as pigs that only exist to be eaten.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.040
Now then...

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.370
Here's the main dish I've been waiting for.

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:41.040
The enemy did set something up for us...

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.160
Big Sister Misa!

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:45.200
Take a look at this. It's the entrance to the barrier.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:48.080
Did Big Brother put the akuma inside a barrier?

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:52.870
The barrier manifestation point is
the little finger of Einheijer's left hand.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:56.000
Th-then where in the world is Takuma?

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:59.830
Could it be that after the barrier was stretched,
he fell victim to the enemy?

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:02.950
It's because we left him on his own!

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.410
There's no point talking about
what what's already done.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.040
For now, we need to do something about that akuma.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:12.040
At this rate the barrier will be broken
and Midgard will perish!

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.700
There are two ways to destroy the barrier.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:18.790
We can either destroy it from the inside,
or destroy it from the entrance on the outside.

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:21.160
Natsuki, stand by in front of the entrance.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:23.450
I need you to guard the outside.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.370
G-got it.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:27.250
But what about you and everyone else?

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:29.410
Until Takuma gets here,

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:34.700
we'll go inside and keep that akuma in check!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.540
It sure is huge now that I'm seeing it up close.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.910
I-I wonder if we'll get out of this alive...

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.660
We're not necessarily trying to defeat it.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.950
Remember what our teacher told us?

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:49.000
When up against a stronger enemy,
the three guidelines are:

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.000
"Don't worry about your weaknesses."

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:53.370
"Don't rush in without a plan."

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.330
"Don't die."

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.830
Surviving means you can
have a meal with everyone again.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.450
That's not something you need to point out to us!

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:02.250
I see. Sorry about that.

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:04.910
Well then, are you two ready?

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:07.790
Sacred Sword "Cannon," strengthened.

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:08.790
Sacred Sword
"Cannon"
strengthened!

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:09.950
Kururi!

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:11.620
Take that!

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:19.580
Keep them apart and don't let their awareness
turn towards the barrier.

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:20.580
Got it!

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.250
There are so many of them!

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.120
Disgraceful!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.410
Oh no...

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.040
C-Captain!

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:46.040
Sorry I'm late.

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:48.410
I-it's okay, you saved us!

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:50.750
I received a message from Misa.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:54.450
She said there's a possibility that weakling
got captured by the enemy.

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.120
Well...

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:59.450
So this is what happens when you're
away from him for even a few moments... Pitiful.

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:02.000
I'm pissed we have to deal with
the consequences of his failures,

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.250
but we'll protect the barrier until the end!

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:06.200
R-right!

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:10.120
Takuma...

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.200
Cooking Room

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.790
please be safe!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.330
Y-yummy! Tasty, tasty, this meal is so tasty!

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:26.450
Those piggies are going to meet their end
without me even laying a finger on them.

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:28.950
The meal I'm having while watching all of this go down...

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.200
It's all so scrumptious!

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:40.910
Don't you agree, Akutsu-senpai?

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.330
What do you think?

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:45.540
How do you like this banquet I'm hosting?

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.750
Have yourself a bite too, Senpai!

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.250
Here, come on!

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:55.370
Get to eating, already!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:15:00.950
How dare you act so ungrateful
towards me for sparing your life? Eh?!

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:06.580
Well, that's fine. The banquet has just started.

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:10.700
Let's take our time and enjoy ourselves...

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:15.750
Let's watch those piggies get sloppily devoured...

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:23.080
I have five string puppets left...

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.290
Can I really hold out?

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.200
Oh no, Itsuyo! That's...

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:35.910
Oh no!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:40.250
My body... No!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.700
Help me, Father...

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.790
Takuma-san!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:47.080
Itsuyo!

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.450
Kururi-chan, wait!

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.410
Love is the source of power?

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.200
You make me laugh.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:57.790
Having to rely on such a thing for power,
it is of no importance.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.370
Big Sister Mutsumi!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.700
Power is the rampaging appetite itself!

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:03.410
You two, stay back!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:12.410
Svadilfari will consume them all.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:14.660
He'll turn the bait into puppets,

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.660
and their pain, their pleasure,

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.290
their souls will all be eaten up.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.700
He's already sunk his fangs in...

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:25.950
All that's left is to savor the flavor.

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:32.120
What's keeping the barrier up
is the fact that the weakling is still alive.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:35.200
I presume that means the enemy has not killed him.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:37.290
What does that mean?

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:40.500
I'm not sure why, but one thing that's clear is

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:45.830
unless the weakling escapes from
the hand of the enemy, it's over for us.

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:48.410
I believe in him.

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:52.410
Because Takuma-kun is our lover!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.160
I can't move my body.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.870
Maybe that's because there's a hole in my stomach

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.870
I wonder what happened to everyone else.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:08.290
No... My mind is so foggy...

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:16.000
Sorry, Mom. I couldn't keep my promise.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:19.870
I'm sorry, everyone...

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.750
Academic
Achievement

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:31.290
Natsuki's Room

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:31.000
E-excuse me.

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:35.000
What do you want? Today's the festival, you know?

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.830
You know we have to practice for the dance.

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:38.870
Dance?

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.790
I-it's nyaathing!

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:46.080
Uh, a-actually, I was thinking I wasn't
a suitable lover after all...

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:49.660
So... I'm very sorry...

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:53.160
And there's no way I can accept this.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:53.450
Academic
Achievement

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:55.040
What? Why?

00:17:55.040 --> 00:18:01.330
I heard from Misa-san that it was highly likely
an enemy would attack during the festival.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:06.080
In other words, you want to run away
because you don't want to put yourself in danger.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:07.580
Is that what you're saying?!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.250
Yes, that's right.

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:15.040
I mean, if I die no one will be able to
transform anymore, right?

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.250
My legs won't stop shaking, even now.

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:25.200
The way that I am now,
I can't do anything when I need to.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:30.290
Leave me behind with everyone who can't fight
and I'll die in an instant!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.540
That's why, well...

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.500
So you really are...

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.750
an idiot.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:36.620
Huh?!

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:39.790
You being incompetent isn't anything new,

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:43.450
and absolutely no one here expects you
to suddenly spring into action now!

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:48.160
If you're always assuming that you're going to die
then there's nothing to be done about that.

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:51.080
That was a waste of time.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.830
Come on, let's get to school.

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:55.330
I-I was being serious about that.

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.790
You can't do anything when the time calls for it?

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.410
Don't be stupid.

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:03.660
Haven't you saved me numerous times
when I needed you?

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:09.080
Both when an akuma was summoned to the park
and when I was attacked in the classroom,

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:12.250
It was just like the first time I met you.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.910
That's why I'm not worried about anything.

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:17.700
I believe in you, Takuma.

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:25.160
I believe that in your soul resides a sword
that's greater than anyone's...

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:26.250
Oh?

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:30.000
Oh no, what's wrong?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.200
You've suddenly got much more motivation!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:35.080
Would you mind not interrupting my meal?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.500
Were you always so callous towards others, Senpai?!

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:42.370
It's true that I'm afraid of people.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:48.290
Just being near them makes me scream,
and they're always making rumors about me,

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:52.250
and not even Natsuki and her sisters
understand this fear. But...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.830
Even though I'm scared...

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:58.540
I didn't mind it!

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.410
Shut up.

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:04.620
Shut up, shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:10.370
I told you not to freakin' interrupt my meal
with your bullshit.

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:13.870
Your stomach is already sliced open, so die.

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:16.250
His stomach is sliced open?

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:19.580
You sure are the type to say some rather brutal things.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:23.330
You look like you're wondering
how I knew you were here.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:30.160
My older sister went around putting an
identifying tag on everyone she passed by.

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:35.290
The people we monitored, including the participants
of the campus festival and the guests,

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:37.870
totals 862.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.870
She also tagged your hair, you know?

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:43.080
With thread.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.120
Now let's see.

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:47.700
Something about this situation
feels somewhat ominous,

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:50.910
so would you mind giving me an explanation
as to what's going on?

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.040
I'm so glad!

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:58.950
Everyone started getting unruly
and so I was hiding with Senpai!

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:00.040
Oh my!

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:03.620
I was so scared it was like my stomach
was going to split open!

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:05.540
Oh my, are you okay?

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.540
So I'm not able to fool you, huh?

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:16.040
You should all just obediently get devoured!

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:22.080
This means that atypical behavior is indeed
involved with the malevolent gods.

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:26.120
I'm going to devour you right here.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:28.750
I don't want your undies.

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:31.910
Instead...

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:34.750
I'll have your life.

00:23:07.410 --> 00:23:11.910
What attacked Natsuki-chan and the others were akuma
that were possessing and manipulating people.

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:13.790
And that guy's the leader?

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:15.830
This is looking a bit troublesome...

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:17.870
Futaba, how's it going in there?

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:20.660
I just came across Takuma-chan.

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:23.040
I also happened across the enemy mastermind.

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:25.700
Futaba, are you okay on your own?

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:29.750
What? Do you understand who you're worrying about?

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:33.040
Y-you're right, my apologies, Your Majesty!

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:41.000
Next time: The Naked Maiden

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:35.540
Next time: "The Naked Maiden"

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:37.870
Your younger sisters will take care of everything here!

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:39.580
We'll leave Takuma to you!
